---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../components/astro/Breadcrumb.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Gibraltar Property Listings | Status" description="Gibraltar property search is not live yet. Read practical buyer guidance and area overviews while verified listings are prepared." image="/images/editorial/gibraltar-city-bay.webp">
  <Breadcrumb items={[{ label: 'Property for sale' }]} />
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-[1100px] px-5 pb-16 pt-10 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:pb-24 lg:pt-16">
    <p class="text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.18em] text-sea-700">Property for sale</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 max-w-4xl font-display text-5xl font-semibold leading-tight text-ink-900 sm:text-6xl">Gibraltar homes for sale</h1>
    <div class="mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-6 sm:p-9">
      <p class="text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.16em] text-terra-600">Listings are not live</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-ink-900">No verified homes to show yet</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-base leading-7 text-stone-600">We are not accepting enquiries or collecting contact details on this page. No sample properties, agent details, asking prices or availability are presented as real listings.</p>
      <div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a href="/areas/" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-ink-900 px-5 text-sm font-bold text-white hover:bg-sea-700">Compare Gibraltar areas</a>
        <a href="/guides/buying-property-in-gibraltar/" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-stone-300 px-5 text-sm font-bold text-ink-900 hover:border-sea-700">Read the buying guide</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-14 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2">
      <article><p class="text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.17em] text-sea-700">When listings launch</p><h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-ink-900">What should be verified?</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-stone-600">A useful listing should identify its source and update date, separate asking price from achieved-sale evidence, describe measured facts consistently and distinguish confirmed features from details that need checking. Availability should be reconfirmed with the responsible agent.</p></article>
      <article><p class="text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.17em] text-sea-700">Market context</p><h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-ink-900">No unsupported estimates</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-stone-600">The tracker explains its proposed measurement approach. It currently has no verified active-listing feed or private-sale dataset, so it does not publish current averages, yields or value estimates.</p><a href="/market/property-price-tracker/" class="mt-4 inline-flex min-h-11 items-center font-bold text-sea-700 underline underline-offset-4">Read the tracker status →</a></article>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
